!! Proposed Definition of ''ce'u''

;__ce'u__ (KOhA8): Lambda. Pseudo-quantifier binding a variable within an abstraction that represents an open place.

Examples of ''ce'u'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''ke'a''

;__ke'a__ (KOhA7): Relativized it. Pro-sumti: relativized sumti (object of relative clause).

Examples of ''ke'a'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''ma''

;__ma__ (KOhA7): Sumti ?. Pro-sumti: sumti question (what/who/how/why/etc.); appropriately fill in sumti blank.

Examples of ''ma'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''zi'o''

;__zi'o__ (KOhA7): Nonexistent it. Pro-sumti: fills a sumti place, deleting it from selbri place structure;changes selbri semantics.

Examples of ''zi'o'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''zo'e''

;__zo'e__ (KOhA7): Unspecif it. Pro-sumti: an elliptical/unspecified value; has some value which makes bridi true.

Examples of ''zo'e'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''zu'i''

;__zu'i__ (KOhA7): Typical it. Pro-sumti: the typical sumti value for this place in this relationship; affects truth value.

Examples of ''zu'i'' Usage

